WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:07.539
Let us build interactive exhibition as a coherent visual system.

2
00:00:07.539 --> 00:00:18.152
Start with composition and reusable components, then move into motion, materials, and controlled variation.

3
00:00:18.552 --> 00:00:25.851
Begin with timing in After Effects and a spatial composition in Cinema 4D.

4
00:00:25.851 --> 00:00:36.997
Animate the reveal, inspect the graph editor, and adjust the camera so the installation has a clear focal point.

5
00:00:37.397 --> 00:00:48.757
Trace a visual variation through ComfyUI, plan a restrained shot in Higgsfield, and refine the scene in Blender.

6
00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:56.770
Resolve connects the cuts and color into one continuous exhibition experience.

7
00:00:57.170 --> 00:01:01.327
Adapt the work into generative installation.

8
00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:12.853
Compare formats side by side, preview the movement, and review the final experience at the size people will actually see.
